                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "). Attributes which are hard set or hard unset in the playbook or component descriptor take precedence over attributes defined in a page. This precedence order can be inverted using the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "precedence modifier"
                  }
